2) Run iotop -oP to find the process reading the most;
3) Compare against the EVS disk type's IOPS ceiling to see whether it has topped out;
4) If it has, upgrade the disk type or expand it; if not, reduce disk reads with caching and better indexes.

1) 用 ip -s link show 与 ethtool -S 确认错包计数:
1) Run ip -s link show and ethtool -S to confirm the error counters;
2) In the cloud the physical layer is the provider's responsibility, so an abnormal error rate should go to a Huawei Cloud support ticket first;
3) At the same time confirm whether the instance flavour's bandwidth cap was exceeded;
4) If redundancy exists, move traffic away to stop the impact.

